      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 1
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "title": "Memory",
      "_base": "row"
    },
    {
      "title": "ns-server mem used",
      "_base": "panel",
      "_targets": [
        {
          "datasource": "{data-source:name}",
          "expr": "sysproc_mem_resident{proc=\"ns_server\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{data-source:name}",
          "_base": "target"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 1
          },
          "unit": "bytes"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "title": "sys_mem_limit and used",
      "description": "sys_mem_limit was ns_server's answer to how much memory this node may use: min(host total, cgroup limit), per memory_quota:choose_limit. It is deprecated (7.6.0) for being ill-defined - it silently means either - in favour of the explicit sys_mem_total and sys_mem_cgroup_limit, which this panel prefers.\n\nThe min is gated on sys_mem_cgroup_limit actually being present, because it only arrived in 7.2.0: on an older snapshot from a container the deprecated sys_mem_limit is the only stat that knows about the cap, and sys_mem_total alone would report host RAM and overstate the limit. sys_mem_total is the last resort. sum without(name) makes the label sets match so `or` picks a single series.",
      "_base": "panel",
      "_targets": [
        {
          "datasource": "{data-source:name}",
          "expr": "(min without(name) (sys_mem_cgroup_limit or sys_mem_total) and sum without(name) (sys_mem_cgroup_limit)) or sum without(name) (sys_mem_limit) or sum without(name) (sys_mem_total)",
          "legendFormat": "{data-source:name} sys_mem_limit",
          "_base": "target"
        },
        {
          "datasource": "{data-source:name}",
          "expr": "sys_mem_actual_used",
          "legendFormat": "{data-source:name} {{name}}",
          "_base": "target"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 1
          },
          "unit": "bytes"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
